# Ghostly Keybearer's "up to one target Room you control" lets its controller choose no target (CR 601.2c, 115.1): on turn 3 the Keybearer hits
# Bot2 while Bot1's Unholy Annex has Ritual Chamber locked, and Bot1 chooses no Room. The ability resolves and unlocks nothing: the Room keeps
# only Unholy Annex unlocked and no Demon is made (the hit that does choose the Room is the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ghostly Keybearer
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

