Bot1.Hand.Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber.Cast(Ability: Unholy Annex)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ghostly Keybearer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Unholy Annex.Doors = Unholy Annex
